==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈfʊntsən/}}
* {{audio|de|De-funzen.ogg|Audio}}

===Etymology 1===
Clipping of {{m|de|funktionieren}} with additional simplification of the consonant cluster {{IPAchar|/ŋkts/}} into {{IPAchar|/nts/}}. Originally in the jargon of IT technicians and computer scientists.

====Verb====
{{de-verb-weak|funzt|funzte|gefunzt}}

# {{lb|de|colloquial|chiefly|slang}} To {{l|en|function}}, to {{l|en|work}}
#: {{ux|de|Also bei mir '''funzt''' das einwandfrei.|Well, it’s '''working''' here without problems.}}

===Etymology 2===
Related with {{m|de|Funzel|t=weak lamp}}.

====Verb====
{{de-verb-weak|funzt|funzte|gefunzt}}

# {{lb|de|obsolete}} To light up an area.

